  "historical_qualification": "Six existing OoW Bazu bodies have explicit returned Smithy Hammer or base armor missing from native success/failure roles. Correct seven existing entry rows: hammer success/failure1 on two Bazu Boots manufacturing bodies3652/27838; base armor failure1 on Gauntlets of Flames3660, Helm of Flames3663, Leggings of Flames3665 and Sleeves of Flames3668; hammer failure1 on Helm of Flames3663. Returned rows become salvage0, preserving component quantities and all other source/data fields. All six corrected complete ingredient/success/failure roles and exact numeric trivials match primary. Current-primary reconstruction, not immutable2013/native failure execution proof. Boots of Flames3653 has an additional Pyrilen Flame return omitted by source and stays held; no omission-to-zero normalization. No Filings chance changes, new bodies, kit, minimum/learning/availability changes or retroactive refunds.",
